+# Vercel AI SDK runtime guidance
+
+In `/src/support-agent.ts`, `generateText` receives the object returned by `buildRequest`, and `prepareStep` returns an `instructions` value. Type checking and static inspection do not establish that this indirect request shape follows a supported direct invocation pattern or whether step preparation preserves or replaces instructions at runtime.
+
+When changing this boundary, prefer a direct `generateText({ ... })` call with the support instruction supplied through the top-level `instructions` option, then verify the effective instruction with a focused runtime test.
